           \"names\"\n            ]\n        },\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n    }\n}\n\nYour are an intelligent agent that control an indoor robot to perform indoortasks.\n\nI just left my home for catching a flight. Please check the status of cooking appliances in the kitchen and perform necessary operations.<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n",
